ps:EntryPointIntegration_S1 a ps:Section ;
    ps:sectionTitle "Choose Your Learning Path" ;
    ps:sectionLevel 2 ;
    ps:sectionOrder 1 ;
    ps:sectionContent """Different personas have different needs. Pick your path:

## 🚀 For Developers (4-Week Path)

**Goal**: Become productive with ontology-driven development

**Week 1**: Mental models and fundamentals
- [Mental Model Shift](fundamentals/MENTAL-MODEL-SHIFT.md)
- [Ontology Fundamentals](fundamentals/ONTOLOGY-FUNDAMENTALS.md)
- [Exercise 01: First RDF Triple](exercises/01-first-triple/README.md)

**Week 2**: CONSTRUCT and templates
- [RDF-First Philosophy](fundamentals/RDF-FIRST-PHILOSOPHY.md)
- [Exercise 02: SPARQL CONSTRUCT Basics](exercises/02-construct-basics/README.md)
- [Exercise 03: Template-Driven Generation](exercises/03-template-generation/README.md)

**Week 3**: Ontology design patterns
- [Deep RDF Mental Models](mental-models/DEEP-RDF.md)
- [Ontology Anti-Patterns](anti-patterns/CATALOG.md)
- [Exercise 04-05: Intermediate exercises]

**Week 4**: Integration with a2a-rs
- [Case Study: a2a-rs Domain Types](case-studies/01-A2A-DOMAIN-TYPES.md)
- [Migration Playbook](migration/PLAYBOOK.md)
- [Exercise 06-07: Advanced exercises]

**Full curriculum**: [4-Week Developer Learning Path](learning-paths/DEVELOPER-4WEEK.md)

## 🤔 For Skeptics (60-Minute Path)

**Goal**: Decide if this is worth investigating

1. [FAQ for Skeptics](skeptics/FAQ.md) (15 min)
2. [Business Case](business/BUSINESS-CASE.md) (20 min)
3. [Case Study: a2a-rs Domain Types](case-studies/01-A2A-DOMAIN-TYPES.md) (12 min)
4. [ROI Calculator](business/ROI-CALCULATOR.md) (13 min)

**Decision point**: If the ROI looks positive for your context, proceed to developer path.

## 💼 For Managers (90-Minute Path)

**Goal**: Understand business case and team impact

1. [Business Case](business/BUSINESS-CASE.md) (20 min)
2. [ROI Calculator](business/ROI-CALCULATOR.md) (15 min)
3. [Migration Playbook](migration/PLAYBOOK.md) (25 min)
4. [Case Studies](case-studies/) (30 min total)

**Deliverable**: Recommendation for adoption, pilot scope, and timeline.

## 🏗️ For Architects (2-Hour Path)

**Goal**: Design ontology-driven architecture for your system

1. [RDF-First Philosophy](fundamentals/RDF-FIRST-PHILOSOPHY.md) (12 min)
2. [Deep RDF Mental Models](mental-models/DEEP-RDF.md) (20 min)
3. [Ontology Anti-Patterns](anti-patterns/CATALOG.md) (25 min)
4. [Migration Playbook](migration/PLAYBOOK.md) (25 min)
5. [Case Studies](case-studies/) (30 min)
6. Design session: Map your domain to RDF (30 min)

**Deliverable**: Architecture decision record (ADR) for ontology adoption.
""" .

